tain databases, ensuring data integrity and efficient query performance.</font></p><p><font color=\"#23262a\" face=\"proxima-nova, sans-serif\">5. System Enhancements: Identify opportunities for system enhancements, feature additions, and technological advancements.</font></p><p><font color=\"#23262a\" face=\"proxima-nova, sans-serif\">6. Team Collaboration: Work closely with UI/UX designers, QA engineers, and other developers to deliver high-quality solutions.</font></p><p><font color=\"#23262a\" face=\"proxima-nova, sans-serif\">7. Troubleshooting and Support: Provide technical support, troubleshoot issues, and implement solutions to ensure seamless CRM functionality.</font></p><p><img src=\"https://800carguru.me/target.png\" style=\"width: 50%; float: left;\" class=\"note-float-left\"><font color=\"#23262a\" face=\"proxima-nova, sans-serif\"><br></font></p>', 'eBuI1uR30NctSzm1dhpmr0:APA91bEdBtxPzSvCLtxhK5-y27fIyNgLA1Mp1WQNl9sEgQEAUWjE6AozD2KNE4LHNiDOXQRRWS9Yv9DuJcCGWJ16Y7lHFvUAel2Jum0saASsXh1BrMa-jbA', '2026-02-05 07:00:00', '2026-02-05 17:00:00', 'Sunday', 12, 1, 2, 52045, 2, 700, 0, '2025-12-09 20:00:00', 'No'),
