orm routine maintenance tasks to ensure the proper functioning of electrical systems.</span><br></p>', 'fB7pzbAChD4BW1A8410O8o:APA91bGce1FNpIGIFXYqmtSa_uQ2XVN1YxWWK8EeMua-Tr6wV_X86by1930Wri15m8d3hYgV95uOkacjhyww2OQFEznqT-VKwV1pXD9XtclQncDzn7Ysa7pdy29IjDWFiMovhIpIR0Yn', '2026-03-03 05:00:00', '2026-03-03 17:00:00', 'Sunday', 34, 0, 2, 52042, 2, 400, 0, NULL, 'Yes'),
