(258, 'Usman Tariq Tariq Javaid ', NULL, 'Usman Tariq', '81dc9bdb52d04dc20036dbd8313ed055', 'Call Center RSA Agent', 'Not Available', 'rsa@cg.ae', 3000, NULL, NULL, 'Call Center', 'Sales', '2024-03-28', '0001-01-01', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000', 'With Them', '0001-01-01', '0001-01-01', '0001-01-01', '0001-01-01', 'Pakistan', 'OUTSIDE', '1998-01-01', '784-1998-7162439-3', NULL, 'Supervisor', 0, '', 'Employed', '', 0, 1, '800carguru.dyndns.org:5188', '1012', 'XML', 1, '', '', 0, '', '2024-03-29 09:56:59', 0, '', 'Dubai, UAE', '<p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">1. Verify and update All incoming leads</span><br style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">2. Assign leads creation and assign on dedicated division.</span><br style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">3. Makes sure 75% conversion on all leads</span><br style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">4. 24hrs deadline on Sales/Follow-up on each lead.</span><br style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">5. Maintain 5 Calling hrs.</span><br style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">6. Meet daily, weekly, monthly Targets as assigned.</span><br style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">7. Handling RSA Complaints (Real Time)</span><br style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">8. Monitor all \"Lost Leads\" on \"Realtime\" and convert to \"Done\" by offering Special Price</span><br></p>