ce Center Sales from Carwash clients)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><u>3. Insurance Companies </u></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">(Attend and arrange meetings with\r\nInsurance companies with maximum conversion of the Insurance companies’ contracts)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">(Make sure to send mails and\r\nqueries to Insurance companies from official mail and notify the management on the same regarding business collaboration, Joint venture option with\r\nidentifying opportunities for business growth.)<o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><u> 4. Performing any other job-related duties as\r\ndirected by the reporting manager</u></b><o:p></o:p></p>', 'flvrO315o5mWizAMHX_VAV:APA91bG08AsxdOBErlcw8fEkazFOfW7Kk0dwWHZe-eMOBKfG_0wcs47ZqxGOY1cbKKaEFS6ByObkAWDlAltJ9kehhZhRvKow2m8CQPXfYMIOhKbkwU-HsR0', '2025-12-26 04:00:00', '2025-12-26 13:00:00', 'Sunday', 14, 0, 2, 52045, 2, 700, 0, '2026-01-09 20:00:00', 'No'),
